-DATASET CSV tinysnb

--

-CASE CallSubqueryUncorrelated
-STATEMENT CALL () { RETURN 1 AS x } RETURN x
---- 1
1

-CASE CallSubqueryUncorrelatedLiteral
-STATEMENT CALL () { RETURN 2 AS a, 'b' AS b } RETURN a, b
---- 1
2|b

-CASE CallSubqueryEmptyInner
-STATEMENT CALL () { RETURN 1 AS c WHERE false } RETURN c
---- 1
|
